# The DECK of a built Walkway piece: the planks, the ledgers and the rails (the legs are walkwayLegs.pre: they stay
# upright). The game puts it on the Walkway's own origin (StructureSystem::updateWalkway), which is 0.1 over the deck
# top, lifted and TILTED to meet the neighbour decks. The collider (tilted with it) is ONE SOLID BOX
# from the deck top (-0.1) down to 0.5 m under the ground (the deck is 2 m over it; the extra 0.5 m covers a sloped
# cell): players and units stand on it, and nothing gets under it (a body that walked into the scaffold got stuck).
Prefab gameWalkwayDeck
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer walkway
		Node WalkwayDeck
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.5 0.36 0.2
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 1 1.25 1
		Offset 0 -1.35 0
